{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "RAKE IN - Scoring Big With Monster Girls!",
    "steam_appid": 3367190,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367190/extras/06e0cdc71a2a78095b93b4cb5bc54b41.avif?t=1750519640\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your guild had built a base on Treasure Island in order to research Magical Beings! Their main objective? To find the storied gold of Treasure Island! Befriend a cavalcade of characters and creatures as you journey through Treasure Island in hopes of discovering the fabled fortune. But be careful... In addition to allies, you'll also meet adversaries like the enigmatic black market trader, Rex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367190/extras/7b6ad16dddbf46998485e29a6c8ffdd5.avif?t=1750519640\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Monster Tamer, you'll have the skills to capture the many Magical Beings/Monster Girls on the island and have them join your party. There's strength in numbers, and you'll have plenty of cuties in your arsenal! You'll also have many stats and abilities to improve. In addition to the usual stats like attack power, agility, and magic defense, you can also use and strengthen passive skills! Figuring out the best time to level up and balance these many skills is all part of the adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367190/extras/ee8b28e0721d790093f6729d2d394c2a.avif?t=1750519640\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367190/extras/066a5c4e7c175885e22b01c5cd11815b.avif?t=1750519640\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367190/extras/9cfd4bf6b13d63b52b65b4ba0ac641ba.avif?t=1750519640\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367190/extras/b2baf0594604a03f19ae04f85d76bbef.avif?t=1750519640\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367190/extras/654f642ba3cd49202c3337e222a3777c.avif?t=1750519640\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Enthralling Legend</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth behind the legend of Treasure Island is revealed to you bit by bit, keeping you on the edge of your seat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capturing Monster Girls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A key feature of the game is capturing the various Monster Girls on Treasure Island as a Monster Tamer. They come in various forms, each having unique powers and abilities. Train them, use them to fight in turn-based RPG combat, and try your best to capture them all!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367190/extras/06e0cdc71a2a78095b93b4cb5bc54b41.avif?t=1750519640\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your guild had built a base on Treasure Island in order to research Magical Beings! Their main objective? To find the storied gold of Treasure Island! Befriend a cavalcade of characters and creatures as you journey through Treasure Island in hopes of discovering the fabled fortune. But be careful... In addition to allies, you'll also meet adversaries like the enigmatic black market trader, Rex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367190/extras/7b6ad16dddbf46998485e29a6c8ffdd5.avif?t=1750519640\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Monster Tamer, you'll have the skills to capture the many Magical Beings/Monster Girls on the island and have them join your party. There's strength in numbers, and you'll have plenty of cuties in your arsenal! You'll also have many stats and abilities to improve. In addition to the usual stats like attack power, agility, and magic defense, you can also use and strengthen passive skills! Figuring out the best time to level up and balance these many skills is all part of the adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367190/extras/ee8b28e0721d790093f6729d2d394c2a.avif?t=1750519640\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367190/extras/066a5c4e7c175885e22b01c5cd11815b.avif?t=1750519640\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367190/extras/9cfd4bf6b13d63b52b65b4ba0ac641ba.avif?t=1750519640\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367190/extras/b2baf0594604a03f19ae04f85d76bbef.avif?t=1750519640\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367190/extras/654f642ba3cd49202c3337e222a3777c.avif?t=1750519640\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Enthralling Legend</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth behind the legend of Treasure Island is revealed to you bit by bit, keeping you on the edge of your seat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capturing Monster Girls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A key feature of the game is capturing the various Monster Girls on Treasure Island as a Monster Tamer. They come in various forms, each having unique powers and abilities. Train them, use them to fight in turn-based RPG combat, and try your best to capture them all!</p>",
    "short_description": "For generations, a legend has been passed down about the mysterious Treasure Island. The island is home to a vast amount of gold... and it could be yours for the taking! Embark on a Monster Girl-catching escapade as you uncover secrets in a riveting search for riches!",
